# Safe minimal slugignore - Backend (FastAPI) only for Heroku

## Exclude entire frontend (deployed separately on Vercel)

frontend/

## Node modules (largest space saver)

node_modules/

## Development artifacts

**/*.map
.cache/
tmp/
logs/
.vscode/
.github/
*.md
!README.md
tests/
.git/
.env.example
.pre-commit-config.yaml
